{"id":"vod_bf_43891","vodId":"43891","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"约会大作战第三季","name_cn":"约会大作战第三季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/b28d94efb0ed3d8a1eb93f9c94e7554a.jpg"},"summary":"人类遭逢了名为“空间震”的新型灾害。震撼空间、将一切破坏殆尽的这一灾厄，是由于精灵自临界显现而发生的。为了阻止空间震，使人类免遭灾厄而必须采取的措施，是使用武力歼灭精灵，或者是——“与其约会，使其娇羞”！　　让精灵娇羞，再通过“亲吻”即可封印其力量——拥有这种能力的高中生·五河士道。为了人类的和平，也为了拯救精灵们——士道在和她们的“约会”中来回奔走。对士道敞开心扉的精灵·十香、四糸乃、琴里、耶俱矢、夕弦、美九，为歼灭精灵而行动的AST，企图利用精灵的DEM，尝试与精灵对话的拉塔托斯克，以及，需要令其娇羞的新精灵——将这一切全部卷入，新的战争约会开始了——","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:11:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuehuidazuozhandisanji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:31.668Z"}